{"mode":"words","text":"Deze woord-voor-woordvertaling heet ‘decoderen’. Het klinkt opzettelijk wat onvloeiend — want zo zie je precies hoe de taal echt in elkaar zit, zonder dat je grammaticaregels uit je hoofd hoeft te leren. Vroeger deed men dit urenlang met de hand, met behulp van een woordenboek. In LinguaFlow neemt de app deze stap volledig van je over — voor elke tekst die je wilt leren.","words":[{"s":0,"e":522},{"s":801,"e":2241},{"s":2310,"e":2508},{"s":2543,"e":3680},{"s":4191,"e":4307},{"s":4365,"e":4656},{"s":4690,"e":5190},{"s":5224,"e":5341},{"s":5399,"e":6014},{"s":6142,"e":6188},{"s":6513,"e":6629},{"s":6653,"e":6745},{"s":6803,"e":6954},{"s":6978,"e":7047},{"s":7094,"e":7454},{"s":7523,"e":7616},{"s":7639,"e":7697},{"s":7755,"e":8011},{"s":8092,"e":8278},{"s":8324,"e":8371},{"s":8417,"e":8719},{"s":8766,"e":9149},{"s":9393,"e":9671},{"s":9706,"e":9811},{"s":9846,"e":9904},{"s":9962,"e":10844},{"s":10879,"e":10983},{"s":11030,"e":11088},{"s":11158,"e":11413},{"s":11436,"e":11634},{"s":11657,"e":11715},{"s":11773,"e":12330},{"s":12655,"e":12992},{"s":13038,"e":13201},{"s":13247,"e":13352},{"s":13398,"e":13549},{"s":13677,"e":14176},{"s":14223,"e":14339},{"s":14362,"e":14408},{"s":14478,"e":15058},{"s":15267,"e":15407},{"s":15442,"e":15778},{"s":15813,"e":15929},{"s":15964,"e":16034},{"s":16092,"e":16777},{"s":17102,"e":17241},{"s":17299,"e":17973},{"s":18298,"e":18541},{"s":18565,"e":18634},{"s":18704,"e":18936},{"s":19052,"e":19319},{"s":19354,"e":19586},{"s":19656,"e":20120},{"s":20155,"e":20271},{"s":20329,"e":20387},{"s":20457,"e":20840},{"s":20956,"e":21014},{"s":21165,"e":21328},{"s":21409,"e":21723},{"s":21792,"e":22094},{"s":22117,"e":22210},{"s":22245,"e":22291},{"s":22326,"e":22489},{"s":22535,"e":23313}]}